      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:3:3:7:2",
      "text": [
        " مَنْ مَاتَ فِي أَقَلَّ مِنْ أَرْبَعَةَ عَشَرَ يَوْماً كَانَ مَوْتُهُ مَوْتَ فَجْأَةٍ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "From him, from Yaqoub Bin Yazeed, from Yahya Bin Al Mubarak, from Buhloul Bin Muslim, from Hafs, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘The one who dies in less that fourteen days (of illness), his death would have been a sudden death’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "2. It is narrated from the narrator of the above Hadith from Ya’qub ibn Yazid from Yahya ibn Mubarak from Buhlul ibn Muslim from Hafs who has said the following: “Abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said that if one dies from an illness within fourteen days, such death is a sudden death.” "
        ]
      }
    },
